# Logicore Velocity Phase-4 — .gitignore (evidence-verified 2026-10-20)
# Every rule below is backed by a file actually present in this repo.
# Docs: README.md, docs/DEPENDENCY_RECOVERY.md, docs/RUNTIME_PROCESS_SMOKE_REPORT.md,
# docs/audit/audit-20-10-26.md, services/python-processing/README.md,
# services/python-processing/.dockerignore, apps/mobile-driver/.expo/README.md

# 1) Environment / secrets — MUST stay out of git
# Evidence: apps/api/.env (966B) CONTAINS LIVE JWT_SECRET=e12fbfce... + DATABASE_URL
# with password (verified via Get-Content). ./.env.local, apps/web-admin/.env,
# apps/mobile-driver/.env.local are local machine config (see audit doc).
# KEEP every .env.example as the committed template.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
!.env.example
!**/.env.example

# 2) Node dependencies — regenerable, never commit
# Evidence: ./node_modules/ + apps/*/node_modules/ (1303 pkgs per audit doc).
# package.json workspaces ["apps/*"]; reinstall via
# `npm install --workspaces --include-workspace-root` (README + DEPENDENCY_RECOVERY.md).
# node_modules.BACKUP-20260902-105933/ + package-lock.BACKUP-20260902-105933.json
# are timestamped recovery backups (verified via Get-ChildItem).
# KEEP package-lock.json (healthy v3 lock, verified header) — ignore only *.BACKUP lock.
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
node_modules.BACKUP-*/
**/node_modules.BACKUP-*/
*.BACKUP-*
**/*.BACKUP-*
package-lock.BACKUP-*.json
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnp
.pnp.js

# 3) Build / compile output — regenerable
# Evidence: apps/api/tsconfig.json outDir dist (tsc build) -> apps/api/dist/main.js.
# apps/web-admin vite build -> apps/web-admin/dist/index.html + dist/assets/
# (index-Bh14xH0b.js 219KB, logo-BbSL0-C1.png 944KB). Audit doc: `vite build ok`.
dist/
build/
**/dist/
*.tsbuildinfo
vite.config.ts.timestamp-*.mjs
vite.config.js.timestamp-*.mjs

# 4) Python cache/venv/test (mirrors services/python-processing/.dockerignore)
# Evidence: .dockerignore lists __pycache__/, *.py[cod], .pytest_cache/, .venv/.
# Found live: logicore_processing/__pycache__/ + tests/__pycache__/ (*.cpython-31*.pyc).
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.venv/
**/.venv/
venv/
ENV/
.pytest_cache/
**/.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
*.egg-info/
.mypy_cache/

# 5) Expo / React-Native local state
# Evidence: apps/mobile-driver/.expo/devices.json is machine-specific, and
# apps/mobile-driver/.expo/README.md says: "No, you should not share the .expo
# folder. It ... is specific to your machine."
.expo/
**/.expo/
.expo-shared/
*.jks
*.keystore

# 6) OS / IDE / editor droppings
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
**/Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# 7) Logs, coverage, test output
*.log
logs/
**/logs/
coverage/
**/coverage/
.nyc_output/

# 8) Local ops leftovers — verified stray files, NOT part of scaffold
# Evidence: ./stop (19B, content "postgresql-x64-16") is a machine note from
# port-5432 conflict debugging (audit doc); zero source references found.
# pgdata rule is preventive (compose uses named volume logicore_pgdata).
stop
pgdata/
postgres-data/
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
dump.rdb

# 9) Uploads / generated reports (runtime artifacts, never source)
# Evidence: Multer single-file 10MB in-memory upload
# (docs/PYTHON_SERVICE_COMPLETION_REPORT.md) — on-disk dirs are runtime-only.
uploads/
tmp/
temp/
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig

# 10) INTENTIONALLY *NOT* ignored (do not add):
# - package-lock.json (655923B healthy v3 lock — reproducible installs)
# - docs/ui/*.png (4 files 0.9-2.1MB, total ~7MB — required mockups listed in
#   docs/P0_LOCKED_RULES_AND_COVERAGE.md s6; all far below GitHub 100MB limit)
# - templates/imports/*.csv (8 import templates), openapi/*.yaml (contract),
#   db/migrations/*.sql (0001-0008 applied cleanly), **/.env.example (templates)

